    "body": "Operations with the same refusal: the refusal was one block in `setup_align::generation_problem`. It applied to each verified 2D kind with non-default area controls:\n- Face\n- 2D Contour\n- 2D Pocket\n- 2D Adaptive\n\nPR #2214 removes it for all four. No follow-up issue is necessary. Other kinds stay refused by the earlier kind refusal (\"not supported yet in an aligned setup\"), and tilted planes by the tilt refusal. Each area read (picks, chains, material, silhouette, heights) already uses the setup frame, so no new transform is added.\n\nfix on issue/2210-aligned-area-controls · PR #2214 · pinned by setup_align_2d_area::turned_adaptive2d_excludes_the_picked_face_where_the_part_lies, turned_pocket2d_excludes_the_picked_face_where_the_part_lies, turned_face_clears_the_band_of_the_turned_pick, turned_contour2d_offset_rides_the_turned_outline · merges when reviewed\n",
